<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Mining Arm Form -->
  <GR_Transform_Hand_DrillArm.label>挖掘臂形态</GR_Transform_Hand_DrillArm.label>
  <!-- EN: Transforms the hand into a mechanical arm that speeds up mining. A built-in auger helps miners find weaknesses in rock faster. It also includes a general-purpose manipulator, which is somewhat clumsy and slightly affects mobility. -->
  <GR_Transform_Hand_DrillArm.description>灰裔通过对帝国的挖掘臂进行逆向分析，并结合自身特性加以改进研发出的形态。与帝国的版本相比，不会损失正常的操作能力。</GR_Transform_Hand_DrillArm.description>

  <!-- EN: Farming Hand Form -->
  <GR_Transform_Hand_FieldHand.label>务农手形态</GR_Transform_Hand_FieldHand.label>
  <!-- EN: Transforms the hand into a mechanical palm that speeds up sowing and harvesting. Several retractable finger-like protrusions can harvest from multiple points on a plant or sow several plants at once. It also includes a general-purpose manipulator, which is somewhat clumsy and slightly affects mobility. -->
  <GR_Transform_Hand_FieldHand.description>灰裔通过对帝国的务农手进行逆向分析，并结合自身特性加以改进研发出的形态。与帝国的版本相比，不会损失正常的操作能力。</GR_Transform_Hand_FieldHand.description>

</LanguageData>
